    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF5_api — Dashboard read API (read-only)\nPublic URLs once active:\n- `GET /webhook/leads?status=detected` (filter optional)\n- `GET /webhook/lead?id=12` (tender + prospect + matches + artifacts)\n- `GET /webhook/artifact?id=3`\n\n### Configure (owner: Dhiya)\n1. Create credential **Supabase Postgres** — Session pooler host `aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com`, port **5432** (NOT 6543 transaction mode: breaks prepared statements) → attach to the 3 Postgres nodes.\n2. Webhooks are PUBLIC → add a secret query param check (IF node `?key=...`) before queries.\n3. `/webhook/artifact` returns the DB row only — file bytes come from the local render service (RENDER_URL) later.\n4. Schema = `db/init.sql` (FROZEN). Status cycle: detected → researched → matched → proposal_ready.",
        "height": 900,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
